// The non-opam DkML lane: a slot-gated orchestrator that delegates to the
// DkML.Win32 (Windows) and DkML.Unix (Linux/macOS) host-build forms and
// re-declares each slot's output manifest. Bundles live in
// DkML.Bundle.values.jsonc.
